sequenceDiagram
  participant Core as libs/core
  participant Gateway as CareerEvidenceGateway
  participant Cmd as Tauri command
  participant Rust as career_evidence
  participant DB as SQLite

  Note over Core,DB: Insert stores a new draft or proposal only
  Core->>Gateway: CareerEvidence draft or proposal
  Gateway->>Cmd: db_insert_career_evidence
  Cmd->>Rust: insert
  Rust->>DB: INSERT
  DB-->>Rust: row
  Rust-->>Gateway: flat row
  Gateway->>Core: rehydrateCareerEvidence
  Core-->>Gateway: CareerEvidence
  Gateway-->>Core: id plus CareerEvidence

  Note over Core,DB: Lifecycle save is one compare-and-set
  Core->>Gateway: id plus confirmed or rejected value
  Gateway->>Cmd: db_save_career_evidence_lifecycle
  Cmd->>Rust: save lifecycle
  Rust->>DB: UPDATE WHERE id AND previous review_state AND unchanged columns
  alt rows updated is 1
    DB-->>Rust: terminal row
    Rust-->>Gateway: flat row
  else rows updated is 0
    Rust->>DB: SELECT id
    DB-->>Rust: current row or none
    Rust-->>Gateway: not found, immutable-field error, or illegal transition
  end
  Gateway->>Core: rehydrate only on success
